<title>USA: Mitek sees Q3 shr loss $0.07 to $0.10.</title>
<headline>Mitek sees Q3 shr loss $0.07 to $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitek Systems Inc said Wednesday order delays hurt its expected revenue for the third fiscal quarter ended June 30, resulting in an about $0.07 to $0.10 per share loss for the quarter.</p>
<p>The company will report its final third quarter results on July 23.</p>
<p>&quot;Several of our larger...customers experienced delays in finalizing customer orders and contracts resulting in reduced shipments for the company,&quot; said John Kessler, president and chief executive.</p>
</text>
